Options:
Review common, helpful options on their own (such as --help), separate from Commands.
This will allow users to separately learn these helpful options which will in turn be applicable to most commands

Terms:
Directory | file folder in device storage
Working directory | currently selected folder
CLI | Command Line Interface
options | optional addition(s) to a command that change what your result will be
arguments | optional addition(s) to a command (such as a file or path) to ensure the command has the correct content 

